    <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_TERRAIN_MAP_PINS_ADV_QUEST">
      <Text>How can I make notes on the map?</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="TXT_KEY_TERRAIN_MAP_PINS_HEADING3_BODY">
      <Text>Map pins enable you to add notes to the maps (both in main and strategic views).[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Press Control-X and then click on the map to place one or more pins.  Press Control-X again to return to normal map mode.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Hover over a pin to read its note.  Right-click the pin to edit, move or delete it.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Press Shift-X to toggle all pins on or off.</Text>
    </Row>
